  weeks after the end of radiotherapy. All patients should receive adjuvant chemotherapy with the same                  
  fluorouracil/leucovorin regimen. The primary end point of the trial was overall survival. RESULTS A total of 733      
  patients were eligible. Grade 3 or 4 acute toxicity was more frequent with chemoradiotherapy (14.6% v 2.7%; P <       
  .05). There was no difference in sphincter preservation. Complete sterilization of the operative specimen was more    
